# The weight store. Outside the working tree by default (~/.sma/store, or
# $SMA_STORE) because "scratch" is a promise that someone will delete it, and
# the append-only model lineage is the one thing that must not be disposable.
# A server's checkout is often read-only, ephemeral, or on a different host
# than the weights.
#
# The *record* -- manifests, provenance, train state, diffs, COMMITTED -- is
# mirrored into models/ and IS tracked. That is the part a reviewer reads, and
# it is what makes an untracked weight file verifiable rather than merely
# claimed. ~175 KB for the whole v001+v002 lineage.
python/scratch/
models/**/model.safetensors
models/**/*.pt
models/**/tokenizer.json

### Runtime data ###
data/
.env
*.log